# ── assets 资产统一管理 ──────────────────────────────────────────
# 大文件/权重一律忽略（git clone 不会带下来，需要手动放置或上传；
# 云训练体检 _probe_assets 会逐项检查缺失）。目录骨架用 .gitkeep 占位，
# 保证 clone 之后 assets 下各文件夹可见。
# 注意：已跟踪文件（configs/*.json、resources/*.png、separate/*.yaml、
# rmvpe/rmvpe_inputs.pth）不受忽略规则影响，clone 时正常带出。
assets/ffmpeg/*
assets/indexes/*
assets/models/*
assets/pretrained/*
assets/rmvpe/*
assets/hubert/**
!assets/ffmpeg/.gitkeep
!assets/indexes/.gitkeep
!assets/models/.gitkeep
!assets/pretrained/.gitkeep
!assets/rmvpe/.gitkeep
!assets/hubert/base/
!assets/hubert/chinese/
!assets/hubert/base/.gitkeep
!assets/hubert/chinese/.gitkeep
# 人声提纯权重（手动下载，单文件最大 639MB）；yaml 清单保留跟踪
assets/separate/*.ckpt
assets/separate/*.th
assets/separate/*.pth

# Runtime configs (migrated to assets/configs/)
/configs/

# Temp files
*.tmp

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# logs
logs
assets/configs/save_state.json

# WorkBuddy local memory
.workbuddy/
